{"id":"Wb2494bb40469ce981bfb21a8","zh":"板边离缝","en":"","name":"板边离缝","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb2494bb40469ce981bfb21a8","text":"板边离缝","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7a7fc3c09faadae5a745","source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"当波长大于等于80 m 时,可认为板中离缝和板边离缝小于等于0.5 mm,可认为当基础变形波长大于80 m 时,不需要对离缝进行修补 [22]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8}]},{"id":"Sc5cec043a0c620671c10","source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8,"language":"zh","text":"由表8可知,当沉降幅值相同时,随着波长增加离缝值逐步减小;最靠近沉降中心的2块板表现为板中离缝,离缝最大值随着波长增加而减小; 旁边2块板表现为板边离缝,离缝最大值随着波长增加而减小;当波长大于等于25 m 时,板中离缝值大于板边离缝。","citations":[{"source_id":"P136","page":8,"page_end":8}]}],"sources":{"P136":{"id":"P136","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","authors":"曾志平,吴霁崟,王卫东,王继军,徐磊,李桩,刘卓","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20240581","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"曾志平等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"道床板边缘处的分离，其高度随沉降波长和位置改变。","language":"zh","source_id":"P136","paper_slug":"2025-study-on-the-deformation-and-the-gap-of-low-vibration-track-under-the-influence-of-foundation-deform","title":"基础变形对弹性支承块式无砟轨道变形及离缝影响研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W0acd1da343a15a92337ba552","name":"Gap at slab edge","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W0acd1da343a15a92337ba552","name":"Gap at slab edge","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W